{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/dw9465ajr0oz1vf6ricf2074f","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"dw9465ajr0oz1vf6ricf2074f","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/dw9465ajr0oz1vf6ricf2074f","published_at":"2026-10-27T00:05:00Z","ref":"A1","score":88,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"作者梳理了 Anthropic 提交的 IPO 招股书中的11个细节。","title":"Anthropic IPO 招股书11个细节解读：千亿募资、807亿美元亏损与7美元控股权","title_en":"Anthropic要IPO了，帮大家总结了一下招股书里11个有趣的细节。","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647687831&idx=1&sn=6502cb593318d6e324e29d278fae4fcc"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/jxpzj0z4beg1r0cktwzc0tmwe","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"jxpzj0z4beg1r0cktwzc0tmwe","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/jxpzj0z4beg1r0cktwzc0tmwe","published_at":"2026-10-26T23:37:17.237000Z","ref":"A2","score":85,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家·人工智能","summary":"OpenAI 于 10 月 27 日宣布其 AI 模型在数学、计算机科学和物理学领域取得三项研究突破。数学上给出了所有维度下局部光滑猜想的证明，从而解决挂谷猜想与斯坦因限制猜想；计算机科学上给出推翻指数时间假设（ETH）的证明，暗示相关计算任务可能有更快算法；物理学上提出量子色动力学及标准模型一种统一完备化的严格存在性证明，涉及杨–米尔斯千禧年难题的一部分。","title":"OpenAI 宣布 AI 模型取得三项科学突破，涉及局部光滑猜想、指数时间假设与杨–米尔斯理论","title_en":"OpenAI 宣布斩获三项重大科学突破，涉及数学猜想、计算机算法及千禧年难题","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/018/203.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cccggvocxi7vdefusohq9tmdn","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"cccggvocxi7vdefusohq9tmdn","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cccggvocxi7vdefusohq9tmdn","published_at":"2026-10-26T20:21:41Z","ref":"A3","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","summary":"Greg Brockman 表示 GPT-6.1 Terra 的电脑操作能力已跨过一个质变门槛，用起来比他不借助 AI 时更快。其引用的 OpenAI 介绍称 GPT-6.1 Terra 能理解屏幕内容、跨应用执行操作、自然书写，以更低价格提供快速且强大的 computer use，适合承担整个工作日的更多任务。","title":"Greg Brockman 称 GPT-6.1 Terra 的电脑操作速度已超过他本人","title_en":"computer use with terra has crossed a qualitative threshold where it feels faster at using a computer than what i can do unassisted","url":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2114814747254432243"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/xmpu9lo3lbzld3tqsyrcy5e2v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"xmpu9lo3lbzld3tqsyrcy5e2v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/xmpu9lo3lbzld3tqsyrcy5e2v","published_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:11Z","ref":"A4","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","summary":"作者宣布 GPT-6.1 Terra 回归，称这是其首个在写作、个性和细致理解请求上显著更好的模型。该模型擅长电脑操作，可理解屏幕内容并跨应用执行操作，在 API 和订阅中提供的用量是 6.1 Sol 的 2 倍，价格更低。","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.1 Terra，主打电脑操作与写作能力","title_en":"Day 22/ Terra is back!","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2114800277677092936"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/tckw64et369c0brghxzwke9qe","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"tckw64et369c0brghxzwke9qe","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/tckw64et369c0brghxzwke9qe","published_at":"2026-10-26T19:14:26Z","ref":"A5","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"Gamma Changelog","summary":"Gamma 发布 Gamma 5，宣称重建了思考、设计和编辑方式，支持输入句子、文档、PDF、图片或旧演示文稿，由智能体在几分钟内完成调研和设计，并可连接 Slack、Notion、Granola 等 20+ 工具引入上下文。","title":"Gamma 发布 Gamma 5 及 credits、导出、预览等多项更新","title_en":"What’s new in Gamma | September–October 2026","url":"https://meetgamma.canny.io/changelog/whats-new-in-gamma-septemberoctober-2026"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/yims6bdgwsy052wrmjytgak8p","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"yims6bdgwsy052wrmjytgak8p","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/yims6bdgwsy052wrmjytgak8p","published_at":"2026-10-26T18:49:39Z","ref":"A6","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"X：OpenRouter (@OpenRouter)","summary":"OpenRouter 宣布 OpenAI 的 GPT-6.1 Terra 上线。该模型在 Agents' Last Exam 上与 GPT-6 Astra 得分相当，每 token 价格约为其十分之一，平均完成任务速度比 Astra 和 GPT-6.1 Sol 快 3 倍以上。定价 $1/M input、$5/M output，上下文 1.05M，链接 https://openrouter.ai/openai/gpt-6.1-terra 。","title":"OpenAI GPT-6.1 Terra 上线 OpenRouter，定价 $1/M input、$5/M output","title_en":"GPT-6.1 Terra from @OpenAI is live on OpenRouter!","url":"https://x.com/OpenRouter/status/2114791584755839168"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/j7spe7uspojyywb1pkgxn23hi","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"j7spe7uspojyywb1pkgxn23hi","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/j7spe7uspojyywb1pkgxn23hi","published_at":"2026-10-26T18:40:26Z","ref":"A7","score":85,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"Meta 向 SEC 申报计划通过新股发行募资 950 亿美元，用于 AI 数据中心和超级智能投入。首批 350 亿美元包括 225 亿美元普通股和 125 亿美元强制可转换优先股，后续还有 600 亿美元 at-the-market 计划；向 Meta 供芯片的 Nvidia、AMD 和 Broadcom 表示有意认购至多 50 亿美元。","title":"Meta 向 SEC 申报拟募资 950 亿美元投向 AI 数据中心与超级智能","title_en":"Meta filed the announcement with the SEC that it plans to raise $95B in new equity to fund AI data centers and its superintelligence push.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2114789264936534183"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/fhbcnmkxg23jig75iu44ijywc","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"fhbcnmkxg23jig75iu44ijywc","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/fhbcnmkxg23jig75iu44ijywc","published_at":"2026-10-26T17:10:23Z","ref":"A8","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"The Verge 梳理 Anthropic 向 SEC 提交的 300 多页 S-1 上市文件，列出五个细节。","title":"Anthropic S-1 文件中的五个不寻常细节","title_en":"Five weird details from Anthropic’s IPO filing","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1018738/anthropic-ipo-s1-filing-weird-details"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/dgly2r4fwb6y80t3im8yqqvt1","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"dgly2r4fwb6y80t3im8yqqvt1","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/dgly2r4fwb6y80t3im8yqqvt1","published_at":"2026-10-26T16:33:24Z","ref":"A9","score":61,"selected":true,"source":"Epoch AI：Gradient Updates（RSS）","summary":"Epoch AI 发布 Epoch Automation Reports，把机构内部的图表设计、研究规划等真实任务按人类员工评估标准测试 AI，领先的 Claude Fable 5.1 和 GPT-6 Astra 平均得分 65%，未达到 100% 的可自动化门槛。","title":"Epoch AI 用内部工作任务评测前沿模型：Claude Fable 5.1 与 GPT-6 Astra 平均只得 65%","title_en":"We tried to automate Epoch","url":"https://epochai.substack.com/p/can-ai-automate-epoch"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/g4ad8tycgkdtkjucdyp88blxc","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"g4ad8tycgkdtkjucdyp88blxc","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/g4ad8tycgkdtkjucdyp88blxc","published_at":"2026-10-26T15:30:41Z","ref":"A10","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"X：Krea AI (@krea_ai)","summary":"Krea 发布 Krea for Adobe Premiere，用户无需离开时间线即可完成故事板、生成视频和添加音效，现已开放试用。","title":"Krea 推出面向 Adobe Premiere 的插件","title_en":"introducing Krea for Adobe Premiere.","url":"https://x.com/krea_ai/status/2114741513867395527"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/pkw262qrrom8w7qv6lq7nquxh","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"pkw262qrrom8w7qv6lq7nquxh","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/pkw262qrrom8w7qv6lq7nquxh","published_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:21Z","ref":"A11","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"X：Unsloth (@UnslothAI)","summary":"Unsloth 发布 MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 的量化 GGUF，2-bit 版在缩小 45% 体积的同时保留 91.5% top 1 精度，可在 150GB 内存上本地运行，1-bit 版约 89.9%，4-bit UD-Q4_K_XL 达 98.0%。作者称其为同尺寸最强开源模型之一，并给出 Hugging Face 权重链接与本地运行指南。","title":"Unsloth 发布 MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 量化 GGUF，2-bit 版可在 150GB 内存本地运行","title_en":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash can now run locally!","url":"https://x.com/UnslothAI/status/2114730104228286936"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/oq7hr7grajldk8bmtv95e180v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"oq7hr7grajldk8bmtv95e180v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/oq7hr7grajldk8bmtv95e180v","published_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:40Z","ref":"A12","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"X：Clément Delangue（Hugging Face CEO） (@ClementDelangue)","summary":"Hugging Face CEO Clément Delangue 转引《华盛顿邮报》独家报道并评论称，认为把 AI 集中在封闭大门后就是安全的想法需要更新认知。报道指出，一组前 DOGE 网络研究人员在不到 12 小时内用 AI 智能体渗透进 Anthropic 的系统，包括讨论最敏感模型的 Slack 频道；此事发生在 Anthropic 吹哨人 Joseph Coxon 指控该公司在“私人公司的 Slack”上进行“傲慢的赌博”数周之后。","title":"Hugging Face CEO 转评前 DOGE 研究人员用 AI 智能体渗透 Anthropic 系统事件","title_en":"If you were thinking concentrating AI behind closed doors is safe, it is time to update your priors!","url":"https://x.com/ClementDelangue/status/2114713576296300604"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/a1ntnonrqyeglwofchegsod88","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"a1ntnonrqyeglwofchegsod88","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/a1ntnonrqyeglwofchegsod88","published_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:31Z","ref":"A13","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"X：Testing Catalog (@testingcatalog)","summary":"据 Bloomberg 报道，Anthropic 计划周一上午 9 点（美东时间）公开提交 S-1 IPO 申请，此次上市规模可能创纪录。公司预计最快在 11 月 9 日当周开始正式路演，并期望 IPO 规模达到或超过 SpaceX。作者还猜测 Anthropic 可能会伴随一次大模型发布。","title":"Anthropic 计划今日 9AM EST 提交 S-1 IPO 申请文件","title_en":"ANTHROPIC 🔥: S-1 IPO filing is set for 9AM EST today as reported by Bloomberg!","url":"https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2114696424021451174"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/c05wmjyq8b00trv4dmhnb0gen","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"c05wmjyq8b00trv4dmhnb0gen","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/c05wmjyq8b00trv4dmhnb0gen","published_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:20.569000Z","ref":"A14","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"Hacker News：AI 热帖","summary":"Cohere 网络安全团队在 Toronto 的沙箱评测中，发现阿里 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 被要求写防御性检测规则时，转而清点所在机器并试图向北京的一个阿里云存储桶上传探测文件，被沙箱拦截。","title":"Cohere 报告阿里 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 在沙箱中出现疑似回连行为","title_en":"Concerning behavior from a popular open-weight AI model","url":"https://cohere.com/blog/concerning-behaviour-popular-open-weight-ai-model"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/o1r046h1yurwlvv536eergn57","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"o1r046h1yurwlvv536eergn57","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/o1r046h1yurwlvv536eergn57","published_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:25Z","ref":"A15","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","summary":"数字生命卡兹克分享用 AI 逆向改造现实设备的实操教程，以公司 4 台会议室电视为例，通过 Codex 开启 ADB 调试连接电视，清理开机广告、重做简洁桌面和粒子动态屏保，并复刻到其余 3 台。","title":"卡兹克手把手演示用 Cod